CVE-2026-17106
# no fixed release yet: docker-buildx 0.38.1 and docker-compose 5.7.0 bundle golang.org/x/net < 0.62.0. expires: 2026-12-07
CVE-2026-78661
# no fixed release yet: docker-buildx 0.38.1 bundles golang.org/x/net 0.59.0. expires: 2026-12-07
CVE-2026-78669
